# Arch boundary allowlist: known violations outside hypervisor/arch/ that are
# not yet migrated. Format: <file> <rule>. scripts/check-arch-boundary.sh fails
# on any violation not listed here AND on any entry here that no longer
# matches, so this file only ever shrinks. Target: empty (ticket #12 of the
# arch-boundary spec, docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-29-arch-boundary-design.md).
hypervisor/boot/main.c board
hypervisor/boot/main.c gic
hypervisor/boot/main.c vtimer
hypervisor/dm/vuart.c arch-path
hypervisor/dm/vuart.c board
hypervisor/dm/vuart.c vgic
